{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1000_p", "source_sha256": "37b22d88a77adade68dffa4cf424728c70aed60a6c75a471824bc99792fd344e", "ja": "（PV公開を記念して行われたサイン会。亜利沙の対応\nは、最後の一人までずっと一環して明るく完璧だった）", "zh": "（为纪念PV公开而举办的签名会。亚利沙从头到尾都始终保持着明朗完美的态度，直到最后一位客人离开。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "034e6b87603332a98018f78d5ad6a91a602c31f569bbf7be83bf7495da457390", "ja": "今日はお客さんがたくさん来てくれて、\n本当に、本当に最高の一日でした……！", "zh": "今天有好多客人来参加，真的是、真的是最棒的一天……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "16b8f576a01ebcb41a334c9212f00b542504bd1964749dbdc92cd9fc80ac362d", "ja": "話が弾みすぎて、時間が延びちゃいましたケド……。\nみなさんと、しっかりお話ができてよかったです！", "zh": "聊得太尽兴，时间拖长了不少……。\n但能和大家好好聊聊，真的很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1003_p", "source_sha256": "68d3a9e758cb07a489b8cc43034a44b8017c75208e73e541efdece8471fc51aa", "ja": "そうか。参加してくれた人たちも、\n亜利沙も幸せな気持ちになれたみたいだな。", "zh": "这样啊。看来，参加的人，还有亚利沙，都感到很幸福呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "3fb05126ed420c3ee8d7fc15823270f4191a4345645c1143fd9c47f93965fe28", "ja": "はい。ありさ、もうずっと胸がいっぱいです……。\nここへ足を運んでくれた、みなさんへの感謝……。", "zh": "是的。亚利沙现在一直都感到无比满足……  \n还有对特地来到这里的大家的感谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "db29a9cd8a72ba56dcfa0b3e1016dc2336945c4f400ab02d1db561e64c86f57e", "ja": "そして、今までありさにサインをくれた\nアイドルちゃんたちへの尊敬の気持ち……。", "zh": "还有，一直以来为亚利沙签名的偶像们……我对她们也充满了敬意……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1006_p", "source_sha256": "768101b6828ed99fc15feccacd2bac83bbb3f3aafd8680481a34f79dd333f72a", "ja": "サインをくれた、アイドルたち……？", "zh": "给了我签名的偶像们……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "0a21f9a1604bf67a04a8c7fb0c3b9e14174db53029f4b8589d9f5a1c3bda82d5", "ja": "そうです。アイドルちゃんたちの様々な神対応に触れ\nありさは心構えを教えてもらいました……。", "zh": "是的。接触到偶像们各种各样的神级应对后，亚利沙明白了该有的心理准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "0e230a12a1f0eafbfa4a2f0cb7cd010bb8d17abd93f64d83abd84b11f56f01b9", "ja": "アイドルちゃんと話した時間は、\nずっと思い出として残り続けますから。", "zh": "和偶像们聊天的时光，会一直作为回忆留存下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "a187c5632fdf405c14f812eca01f124085c30474f967523690c18f99b367d256", "ja": "だから、ありさがしてもらって嬉しかったことを\nみなさんにも、してあげたかったんです……。", "zh": "所以，我也想把让亚利沙感到开心的事，带给大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1010_p", "source_sha256": "238963df4ee2b3af196924a7e310620f11b9cf916a8b0db12453c9952ae930ef", "ja": "そうだったのか。\n亜利沙の強みを活かせたわけだな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n也就是说，发挥了亚利沙的优势啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "564befb504b0d2ba934524707f1885d86e25eec455c4953d1c96452d948af120", "ja": "えへへ……。えらそうなことをいいましたけど、\nサイン会の最中は、いっぱいいっぱいだったんですよ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……虽然说了些自以为是的话，\n但在签名会期间，我其实已经忙得不可开交了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "6e620aa50647e2b93dffa6793019123448a06d40a993636e6b92a069d1fde97f", "ja": "でも……あの時のことを思い返したら、\nアイドルちゃんになったからには頑張ろうって思えて。", "zh": "可是……回想起那时候的事，我就觉得，既然成为了偶像，就得努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1013_p", "source_sha256": "001ef3fa4a12ba4060dd62811a3f81abd36ebd17a7a6d3e51dfd34913def4057", "ja": "あの時って？", "zh": "你说的是那时候？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "25ba774463f977f84dd1d3f702d6550168297bf8aa4e157b0bcaf0ab55a83893", "ja": "ありさがアイドルになる前……パパと一緒に\n765プロのサイン会に行ったことがあるんです。", "zh": "在亚利沙成为偶像之前……曾经和爸爸一起\n去过765事务所的签名会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "83986b4777c1c933747597dd2766b41e805b1c514558cb07254212d217c5c319", "ja": "短い時間でしたけど。春香さんは嬉しそうに、\nありさの話を聞いてくれました……。", "zh": "虽然时间很短。但春香小姐很开心地听了亚利沙说的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "f863395353da3391588ae0b18bab5bfc151b62c8c16d55b47e0aef4e5288ba6c", "ja": "それがすごく嬉しかったから、あの時の春香さんに\n近づけるように、やってみようかなって。", "zh": "正因为那让我特别开心，所以我也想试试看，努力接近那时的春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2b36f5a2b8bd6f9c999bce95e605e7393924398446eeb924660118c118833677", "ja": "いいと思うよ。そうやって、いろんな人の思いが\n繋がってるなんて、素敵じゃないか！", "zh": "我觉得挺好的啊。像这样能把许多人的心意\n联系在一起，不是很棒吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "a65820bbf5ce8495280da75bdd577b61ca76e66ed4828ba2c5a3d224761f1209", "ja": "って、うっかり恥ずかしい話をしてしまったような！？\nあと、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "等等，好像一不小心说了些丢人的事！？还有，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0614_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "ff7fc318d1bcf73d03b8fbb1c0a20958f75185f13bc6fdc5a3051a65e95e0a58", "ja": "今の話、春香さんには秘密でお願いしますね！\nご本人に知られたら、ありさは……ありさは……！", "zh": "刚才的话，请务必对春香保密哦！\n要是被本人知道了，有纱就……有纱就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
